[
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00002",
    "bgm": "056"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今日もお疲れ様",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003050010,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "お疲れ様でした",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "007",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100700305/1007003050010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じゃあ、明日の予定だけど。午前中はアンティーカでの\r\nレッスンと、個人の自主トレで埋まってる",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お昼は移動しながらだな。13時から取材と撮影のために\r\nスタジオに行って、夕方はラジオだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003050020,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あ、夜時間あったら踊りたーい",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700305/1007003050020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "んん！？\r\nちょっと待て、昨日だって急にレッスン増やしただろ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003050030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "メイクレッスンなんて動いたうちに入らないよー\r\n放っておいたってやるんだから",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700305/1007003050030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、まぁ、結華の感覚的にそうなのかもしれないが──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……やっぱり明日は仕事が終わったら休んでほしい\r\n週末、一日合同練習が入ってるだろ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そこで大きく動く分、\r\nそれまでは抑えめにしておいてもらいたいんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003050040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "え～\r\nその合同練習で恥かきたくないから練習したいのに？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700305/1007003050040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どこがそんなに気になるんだ？\r\n一回確認させてくれないか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003050050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──おっけ！\r\nじゃあ午前の自主トレの時間に見てもらっていい？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700305/1007003050050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003050060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "それで改めて相談",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700305/1007003050060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "わかった\r\n──よし。なら今ので確認は終わりだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003050070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "はーい",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700305/1007003050070"
  },
  {
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003050080,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──……そういえばさ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700305/1007003050080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003050090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "『無理してないか？』とか、聞かないんだね",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700305/1007003050090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……してるのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003050100,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "いやー？\r\nでもほら、心配じゃないのかなぁって",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700305/1007003050100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003050110,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……三峰のこれまでとか、性質とか鑑みて",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700305/1007003050110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うーん……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これまでとか、性質とかを鑑みて、\r\nここで隠れて無理とかはしないと思ってるんだけどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003050120,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……なんで？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700305/1007003050120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結華は真面目だから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003050130,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700305/1007003050130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "この間、結構腹割って話しただろ？\r\nそれで『一緒に無茶する』って決めたんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なのにひとりで無理をしてたら、裏切ってるってことになる\r\nそういう誠意がないことはしないんじゃないか？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003050140,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あー…………",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700305/1007003050140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003050150,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……ごめんね？\r\n三峰今めんどくさい質問した",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700305/1007003050150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "別にそうは思わないけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003050160,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700305/1007003050160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。──でも\r\n仮に面倒くさかったとしても構わないって覚えててくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結華が聞いて、俺が答えて、\r\nそれで結華が納得できるならいいし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "納得できないんだったら、できるまでちゃんと話したい\r\nそれは俺のやりたいことだから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003050170,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……今遠回しに『ちゃんと頼れよ』って言われてる？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700305/1007003050170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや？　言わなくても頼ってくれるんだろ\r\nだからまぁ……俺の性質についての申告──か……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003050180,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……あはは",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700305/1007003050180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003050190,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "おっけおっけ、ちゃんと覚えとく",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700305/1007003050190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003050200,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……でもさぁ\r\nプロデューサー、ちょっと三峰をよく見すぎじゃない？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700305/1007003050200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003050210,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そうだよ、三峰つかまえて真面目とかさぁ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700305/1007003050210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003050220,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……でもまぁ、そう見えてるならそれでいいのか\r\nアイドルは夢を見せる職業だもんね",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700305/1007003050220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺が見てる結華は夢だって？",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003050230,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ふふ、理想って言い換えてもいいかもだけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700305/1007003050230"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003050240,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……──みんなに最高の夢を、理想の三峰を\r\n見せ続けたいの",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700305/1007003050240"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003050250,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "もちろん、最初のファンであり、\r\nプロデューサーでもあるＰたんには！　特にね！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700305/1007003050250"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007003050260,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ふふっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700305/1007003050260"
  },
  {
    "label": "end",
    "textFrame": "off"
  }
]